    description: "Found by the 2026-10-06 docstring audit tail pass; reviewer reproduced: the COBOL pass emitted 9 nodes and 5 edges, the default survey kept 6 nodes and 0 edges; with --include-docs 4 call edges come back. WI-tisom fixed the same shape for kind=property via _NOISE_PROPERTY_LANGUAGES; section/paragraph need the same language scoping (markdown/rst/asciidoc etc. keep being filtered)."  # 95d2
    fields:  # 95d2
      statement: "A kind used for documentation structure in one language and for callables in another is filtered only for the documentation languages (the rule WI-tisom applied to property)."  # 95d2
      root_cause: "noise_filter._NOISE_SYMBOL_KINDS lists 'section' and 'paragraph' as documentation kinds (~L77-78) and is_noise_symbol filters them by kind alone (~L113), with no language scope; cobol.py emits both kinds for PROCEDURE DIVISION callables."  # 95d2
